WEBVTT

00:03:59.759 --> 00:04:01.629
a simple set of instructions

00:04:01.629 --> 00:04:05.229
before they plunge into the labyrinth
in search of the exit.

00:04:05.229 --> 00:04:09.508
What directions can she give them so
they can quickly navigate the maze,

00:04:09.508 --> 00:04:13.508
open the door, and guide Ethic
straight back to the crystal?

00:04:13.508 --> 00:04:20.331
Pause now to figure it out for yourself.

00:04:20.331 --> 00:04:21.116
Hint in 3

00:04:21.116 --> 00:04:22.090
Hint in 2

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:22.805
Hint in 1

00:04:22.805 --> 00:04:24.115
Here’s a hint:

00:04:24.115 --> 00:04:28.548
One of the challenges here is to find 
a way to indicate where dead ends are,

00:04:28.548 --> 00:04:32.208
so that the resistance members
don’t keep going down them.